def author(register,source,compact):
 source('crossrail-monitoring','橫貫鐵路監測結案報告','Instrumentation and Monitoring Close Out Reports','Crossrail Learning Legacy','https://learninglegacy.crossrail.co.uk/documents/instrumentation-and-monitoring-close-out-reports/','業主公開的監測資料結案與工程背景，支援監測證據及交接實務。','Owner-published monitoring close-out and engineering context, supporting evidence and handover practice.')
 source('stepney-settlement','史特普尼綠地沉陷與體積損失研究','Surface settlement and volume loss at Stepney Green','Crossrail Learning Legacy','https://learninglegacy.crossrail.co.uk/documents/an-investigation-of-surface-settlement-and-volume-loss-associated-with-scl-tunnelling-at-stepney-green/','施工團隊公開的噴凝土襯砌開挖沉陷研究；本課算例獨立假設，不冒充該工程量測。','Project-team study of settlement during SCL excavation; course calculations are separate assumptions, not project measurements.')
 source('central-line-deformation','中央線隧道誘發應變與變形','Tunnelling induced strains and deformations at Central Line','Crossrail Learning Legacy','https://learninglegacy.crossrail.co.uk/documents/tunnelling-induced-strains-and-deformations-at-central-line/','鄰近既有隧道變形與應變的業主公開研究，用於多種量測的交叉解釋。','Owner-published study of movement and strain in an existing tunnel, supporting cross-interpretation of measurements.')
 source('amberg-survey','隧道測量與斷面監測','Tunnel Surveying Solutions','Amberg Technologies','https://ambergtechnologies.com/fields-of-activity/underground/tunnels','測量供應者對隧道斷面、變形與施工測量的公開技術分類；不作精度承諾。','Supplier overview of tunnel profiles, deformation and construction surveying; not a course accuracy guarantee.')
 compact('b131','以法向條件、粗糙峰破壞與位移歷程區分節理峰值和殘餘抗剪~Separate peak and residual joint resistance through normal boundaries, asperity damage and displacement history',['isrm-methods','geo3'],r'''
法向應力與摩擦~Normal stress and friction||節理抗剪力由接觸面法向約束與表面特性共同產生，切向力不應單獨解讀。線性摩擦包絡是指定應力範圍的近似，外推到低應力可能虛構黏聚力，高應力又可能壓碎粗糙峰。~Joint resistance depends on normal confinement and surface condition, not shear force alone. A linear envelope approximates a specified stress range; extrapolation can invent low-stress cohesion or miss asperity crushing under high confinement.||假設c=0、σn′=1 MPa、φ=35°，τ=σn′tanφ=0.700 MPa；摩擦角φ降25°時為0.466 MPa。~Assume c=0, σn′=1 MPa and φ=35°; τ=σn′tanφ=0.700 MPa, falling to 0.466 MPa at φ=25°.||以多個法向應力級試驗並保留完整位移曲線，分別擬合峰值與殘餘值；只有涵蓋設計應力範圍且試件狀態一致的包絡才可交付，不把兩點擬合視為普遍定律。~Test multiple normal stresses and retain complete displacement curves, fitting peak and residual envelopes separately; deliver envelopes only over represented design stresses and consistent specimen conditions rather than treating a two-point fit as universal.||不同粗糙度試件混合擬合會產生假的黏聚截距，進而高估低約束節理強度；開挖卸荷後最需要保守判讀的區間反而被外推誤導。~Mixing specimens with different roughness can create a false cohesion intercept and overestimate low-confinement resistance, misleading the unloading conditions most relevant beside a newly excavated tunnel.
孔壓與有效法向力~Pore pressure and effective normal force||水壓減少有效接觸約束，但充填物內的孔壓是否均勻取決於排水與載入速率。名義外加法向荷重不等於節理有效法向力，局部未排水反應也不能用遠處水位直接代替。~Water pressure reduces effective contact confinement, but its distribution through infill depends on drainage and loading rate. Applied normal force is not effective normal force, and a distant water level cannot represent local undrained response.||假設σn=1.2 MPa、u=0.4 MPa，σn′=0.8 MPa；摩擦角φ=30°時抗剪應力τ=0.8tan30°=0.462 MPa。~For assumed σn=1.2 MPa and u=0.4 MPa, σn′=0.8 MPa; at φ=30°, τ=0.8tan30°=0.462 MPa.||將孔壓、法向力及剪力以相同時鐘記錄，檢查排水管線與試體飽和狀態；比較不同速率試驗能否達到同一有效應力路徑，未量到界面孔壓時需明列推估限制。~Synchronize pore pressure, normal force and shear and check drainage and saturation; compare whether different rates achieve the same effective stress path, explicitly limiting results when interface pore pressure is inferred rather than measured.||把總應力代入摩擦式會高估含水弱面強度，孔壓感測器延遲又可能漏掉峰值；試驗看似排水，真正剪切面卻仍可能累積超額孔壓。~Using total stress overestimates wet-joint strength, and delayed pressure sensing can miss peaks. An apparently drained test may still accumulate excess pressure directly at the shearing surface.
定力與定剛度邊界~Constant-load and stiffness boundaries||節理剪脹會推動法向邊界，定法向力設備容許位移而保持應力，定剛度邊界則使應力隨剪脹增加。實際圍岩介於不同約束情境，兩種試驗曲線不能直接混成同一材料定律。~Dilation moves the normal boundary. Constant-normal-load testing permits movement at fixed load, while constant-normal-stiffness testing increases stress as dilation develops. Actual surrounding rock imposes a specific constraint, so the curves are not interchangeable material laws.||假設法向剛度kn=2 MPa/mm、剪脹0.3 mm，Δσn=knΔvn=0.6 MPa；未計設備柔度。~With assumed normal stiffness kn=2 MPa/mm and dilation 0.3 mm, Δσn=knΔvn=0.6 MPa, excluding machine compliance.||以標準件校準設備柔度，核對控制器維持的是力、位移還是剛度；將實際法向應力歷程與目標比較，並由設計者說明試驗邊界如何代表隧道周圍岩體。~Calibrate machine compliance with a reference block and verify whether control maintains force, displacement or stiffness; compare actual normal histories with targets and require the designer to justify their representation of surrounding ground.||把設備的高剛度效應當成節理本身高強度，會在低約束現地高估承載；控制迴路遲滯則可能製造不實峰值或錯誤剪脹曲線。~Interpreting high machine confinement as intrinsic joint strength overestimates resistance under low field restraint. Controller lag can also create a spurious peak or misleading dilation curve.
剪脹與幾何攀升~Dilation and geometric climbing||粗糙峰互相攀升造成剪脹，同時提高切向阻力；隨法向應力增加，峰體可能剪斷而減少幾何攀升。剪脹角是位移路徑斜率，不能當成所有位移階段固定的摩擦增量。~Asperities climb over one another, generating dilation and additional resistance. Greater confinement may shear them off and reduce climbing. Dilation angle is a displacement-path slope, not a constant friction increment throughout the test.||假設剪移2 mm產生法向增量0.2 mm，ψ=atan(0.2/2)=5.71°；此為該段平均角。~Assume 2 mm shear displacement produces 0.2 mm normal movement; ψ=atan(0.2/2)=5.71°, averaged only over that interval.||用雙側位移計檢查試件傾斜，逐段求法向對剪向位移斜率；比較剪後表面與碎屑，判定剪脹降低是粗糙峰破壞或儀器轉動，不能只看一支量規。~Use displacement gauges on both sides to detect rocking and evaluate incremental slopes; compare post-test surfaces and debris to distinguish asperity damage from instrument rotation rather than relying on one gauge.||試件轉動可假裝成剪脹，若用此角度提高強度會造成雙重高估；剪後磨平卻仍沿用初始剪脹角，也會錯估大位移殘餘行為。~Specimen rotation can masquerade as dilation and falsely increase inferred resistance. Retaining initial dilation after the surface has polished also misrepresents large-displacement residual behavior.
峰值與殘餘強度~Peak and residual resistance||峰值需要原有咬合或膠結尚未破壞，殘餘強度則對應較大位移後形成的滑動面。隧道附近若已有位移歷史，直接採首次峰值可能不適當，應先辨識設計機制需要哪一段。~Peak resistance depends on surviving interlock or bonding, while residual resistance follows development of a sliding surface. Previously displaced ground may not mobilize a first-cycle peak, so the required part of the curve depends on the design mechanism.||假設峰值0.9 MPa、殘餘0.5 MPa，峰後降幅(0.9−0.5)/0.9=44.4%；不是安全係數。~Assumed peak and residual stresses of 0.9 and 0.5 MPa give a post-peak drop of 44.4%; this is not a factor of safety.||保留足夠位移範圍的曲線並檢查是否真正進入穩定滑動，註記試件先前剪切與方向；設計參數表應分列峰值、軟化過程和殘餘，不以一個平均值替代。~Retain curves over enough displacement to assess stable sliding and document prior shearing and direction; parameter tables distinguish peak, softening and residual behavior rather than replacing all three with one average.||試驗行程不足時末端值不一定是殘餘值，重複使用磨損面又會低估首次峰值；若未記錄試件歷史，兩種錯誤都可能混入同一資料庫。~Insufficient travel means the final reading may not be residual, while reusing a worn surface understates the first peak. Without specimen history both errors can enter one apparently consistent database.
剪切面積修正~Shearing-area correction||剪切位移增加會減少上下試件的重疊面積，若仍以初始面積換算應力，就把幾何變化混入材料軟化。對不規則天然節理還需考慮實際接觸區，名義重疊不等於真實接觸。~Shear movement reduces specimen overlap, so initial-area stress mixes geometry with material softening. Irregular natural joints also have evolving contact patches; nominal overlap is not the true contact area resisting shear.||假設矩形100×100 mm試件剪移10 mm，重疊9000 mm²；剪力9 kN對應1.0 MPa，初始面積算法為0.9 MPa。~An assumed 100×100 mm specimen displaced 10 mm has 9000 mm² overlap; 9 kN gives 1.0 MPa instead of 0.9 MPa using initial area.||從試件幾何與實測位移逐點重算名義面積，並保存未修正與修正應力曲線；若天然表面接觸範圍未知，說明名義面積定義，不用影像猜出的接觸率任意再放大應力。~Recalculate nominal area at each measured displacement and retain corrected and uncorrected curves; if natural contact area is unknown, state the nominal definition rather than arbitrarily amplifying stress through a guessed contact fraction.||忽略面積縮小會把實際穩定阻力誤判為軟化，重複做面積修正又會高估強度；兩者在大位移段尤為嚴重並影響殘餘值。~Ignoring reduced area can make stable resistance appear to soften, while applying correction twice overestimates strength. Both errors become pronounced at large displacement and bias residual values.
速率與排水時間~Rate and drainage time||細粒充填的排水時間取決於排水距離和固結係數，剪切太快會改變孔壓而非只改變摩擦。岩石接觸面也可能有速率效應，所以速度比較必須維持相同水文與正向約束。~Fine infill drainage depends on path length and consolidation coefficient; rapid shearing changes pore pressure as well as friction. Rock contacts may themselves be rate sensitive, so rate comparisons need matched hydraulic and normal boundaries.||假設特徵排水距離5 mm、cv=10⁻⁸ m²/s，t=L²/cv=2500 s約41.7 min；此為尺度估算。~For assumed drainage length 5 mm and cv=10⁻⁸ m²/s, t=L²/cv=2500 s, about 41.7 min; this is a scaling estimate.||比較剪切時間與排水尺度並監測孔壓，使用不同速度時保持相同飽和與邊界；試驗方案由專業人員選定，課程時間估算不能替代規範要求或直接成為設備速率設定。~Compare shearing duration with drainage scale while monitoring pressure, holding saturation and boundaries constant across rates; specialists select the test program, and this time estimate does not prescribe a machine rate or replace a standard.||將未排水弱化歸因於表面磨耗會選錯殘餘參數，反之緩慢試驗的高阻力也不能代表快速卸荷；缺少孔壓資料時兩種機制很難分開。~Attributing undrained weakening to surface wear selects the wrong residual parameter, while slow-test resistance does not represent rapid unloading. Without pore-pressure records the mechanisms are difficult to distinguish.
粗糙度與尺度差~Roughness and scale dependence||小試件可被單一粗糙峰主導，大節理面則包含多種波長與接觸區。量測粗糙度要標明剖面方向和解析度，因為順層與橫層剪切可能呈現不同咬合，不能用一條剖面代表所有方向。~One asperity may dominate a small specimen, while a large joint contains multiple wavelengths and contacts. Roughness profiles require direction and resolution because interlock differs by shearing direction; one trace cannot represent the entire surface.||假設同高程差2 mm在10與100 mm基長上，平均坡度分別0.2與0.02；尺度改變使表觀坡度差10倍。~An assumed 2 mm height change over 10 and 100 mm baselines gives slopes 0.2 and 0.02, a tenfold apparent difference caused by scale.||沿預期剪切方向量測多條表面剖面，另以三維掃描查空間差異；報告點距、濾波與試件尺寸，使用經驗粗糙度模型時需明列其適用尺度和法向應力範圍。~Measure multiple profiles along expected shear direction and compare three-dimensional scans; report spacing, filtering and specimen size, explicitly bounding the scale and normal-stress range of any empirical roughness model.||低解析掃描會抹去細峰，高解析噪訊又可能誇大粗糙度；若把不同濾波的指標混合比較，得到的強度差可能只是資料處理差異。~Coarse scanning removes fine asperities while high-resolution noise exaggerates roughness. Combining differently filtered indices can make a processing difference appear to be a genuine difference in shear resistance.
量測誤差與強度~Measurement error and strength||力與面積的不確定性共同控制換算應力，摩擦角又透過非線性反正切求得。只報設備力計精度會漏掉天然表面尺寸、傾斜與法向控制誤差，須以完整誤差鏈說明結果。~Force and area uncertainty jointly control stress, while friction angle follows a nonlinear inverse tangent. Load-cell accuracy alone omits natural-surface dimensions, rocking and normal-control error, requiring the complete measurement chain.||假設力標準不確定2%、面積3%，獨立小誤差下應力相對不確定√(0.02²+0.03²)=3.61%。~Assume independent small standard uncertainties of 2% in force and 3% in area; relative stress uncertainty is √(0.02²+0.03²)=3.61%.||用校準紀錄與重複尺寸量測估計不確定度，檢查面積和位移是否共享同一誤差來源；對關鍵強度參數做上下限分析，只有差異大於量測與試件散布時才主張材料確有變化。~Estimate uncertainty from calibration and repeated dimensions, checking shared error sources in area and displacement; bracket strength parameters and claim material differences only when they exceed measurement uncertainty and specimen variability.||只看小數位數會把統計不顯著差異解釋成地質分區，忽略相關誤差又使平方和估計過小；設計採值因此可能對不存在的差異過度反應。~Decimal precision can make insignificant differences look like geological domains, while ignored correlation understates propagated uncertainty. Design may then respond strongly to distinctions unsupported by the measurements.
剪切功與試後證據~Shear work and post-test evidence||剪切曲線下的面積表示單位面積做功，包含摩擦、粗糙峰破壞和設備儲能，並非全轉成可量測的熱。試後表面和碎屑讓能量解釋有物理依據，也揭露試體是否走錯破壞面。~Area under the shear stress-displacement curve represents work per unit area, shared among friction, asperity damage and machine energy rather than entirely measured heat. Post-test surfaces and debris test that interpretation and identify unintended failure planes.||假設平均剪應力0.6 MPa、滑移5 mm，W/A=τδ=3000 J/m²；未分離可回復儲能。~With assumed mean shear stress 0.6 MPa and slip 5 mm, W/A=τδ=3000 J/m², without separating recoverable stored energy.||數值積分原始曲線並核對位移零點，試後拍攝上下表面與碎屑位置；交接時把能量、峰殘值和破壞路徑一起提供，由試驗及設計負責人確認是否代表目標節理。~Integrate the original curve with a checked displacement zero and photograph both surfaces and debris; hand over work, peak-residual values and failure path together for laboratory and design leads to judge representativeness.||試件在膠結座或完整岩內破壞時，做功不能歸因於目標節理；若只留下最大剪力而丟失曲線與試後照片，後人無法辨認這種失真。~Failure through the mounting material or intact rock invalidates attribution of work to the intended joint. Retaining only peak force and discarding curves and photographs prevents later detection of that error.
''')
 compact('b132','以基準穩定、沉陷槽形與時間關聯區分開挖及地下水影響~Separate excavation and groundwater effects using stable benchmarks, trough geometry and time correlation',['stepney-settlement','crossrail-monitoring'],r'''
沉陷槽形與參數~Settlement-trough geometry||高斯沉陷槽用最大沉陷和寬度概括橫向地表變形，適合初步描述卻未必適合淺覆土、分層或強烈建物約束。斷面不足時兩參數互相補償，應以完整測點而非只看中線峰值。~A Gaussian trough summarizes transverse movement with peak settlement and width, but shallow cover, layering and structural restraint can violate it. Sparse observations allow parameters to compensate for each other, requiring a full profile rather than only the centerline.||假設Smax=10 mm、i=5 m，x=5 m處S=10e⁻⁰·⁵=6.07 mm；假設沉陷向下為正。~Assume Smax=10 mm and i=5 m; at x=5 m, S=10e⁻⁰·⁵=6.07 mm, taking downward settlement as positive.||以同一時間窗的橫斷面測點擬合並檢查殘差是否偏向一側，與地層及建物分布對照；量測涵蓋槽外穩定點，未覆蓋兩翼的斷面不得宣稱已可靠辨識槽寬。~Fit points from one time window and inspect asymmetric residuals against geology and buildings; include stable points outside the trough and do not claim reliable width identification when both flanks are unobserved.||用單點峰值推算整個沉陷槽會漏掉偏斜與多峰，擬合曲線可能穿過資料卻錯估影響範圍；鄰近建物的差異沉陷便被低估。~Inferring the entire trough from one peak misses skew and multiple lobes. A fitted curve can pass through the available data yet misrepresent the influence zone and underestimate differential building movement.
體積損失換算~Volume-loss conversion||地表沉陷面積代表每單位隧道長度的地表體積變化，與開挖面積比得到表觀體積損失。排水固結、隆起與橫向位移會改變對應關係，不能把它視為直接秤出的超挖土量。~Surface settlement area gives volume change per unit tunnel length, and its ratio to excavation area is apparent volume loss. Consolidation, heave and lateral movement alter the correspondence, so it is not directly weighed overexcavated soil.||假設Smax=0.01 m、i=5 m，Vs=√(2π)iSmax=0.1253 m²；直徑6 m面積28.274 m²，VL=0.443%。~Assume Smax=0.01 m and i=5 m; Vs=√(2π)iSmax=0.1253 m². A 6 m diameter gives area 28.274 m² and VL=0.443%.||以量測斷面數值積分和高斯積分互相核對，統一沉陷單位與開挖直徑；比較施工後不同時段的面積變化，若有地下水降低，將延時固結與即時開挖損失分別討論。~Cross-check numerical profile integration against the Gaussian integral with consistent units and excavation diameter; compare later epochs and distinguish delayed consolidation from immediate excavation loss where groundwater has fallen.||把毫米當公尺會使體積損失放大千倍，漏掉槽翼又會系統性低估；不同時間的峰值和寬度混用，則會算出未曾存在的沉陷體積。~Confusing millimetres with metres inflates volume loss a thousandfold; omitted flanks underestimate it. Combining peak and width from different epochs creates a settlement volume that never actually occurred.
穩定基準與閉合~Stable benchmarks and closure||沉陷是相對基準的高程變化，基準點自己移動時整個監測網會出現共同假訊號。基準需位於影響區外且有冗餘連接，水準路線閉合只能檢查內部一致，不能證明全網絕對穩定。~Settlement is elevation change relative to a benchmark. A moving reference creates a common false signal. Redundant external references are required; leveling closure tests internal consistency but does not prove absolute network stability.||假設觀測點讀得下沉8 mm，基準本身下沉3 mm，真實相對外部穩定基準沉陷為11 mm。~If an assumed point appears to settle 8 mm relative to a benchmark that itself settles 3 mm, settlement relative to a stable external datum is 11 mm.||閉合水準網連到多個外部控制點，檢查共同位移模式與獨立GNSS或深層基準證據；基準疑似移動時保留原讀值，經測量主管核准後以可追溯方式重建高程歷程。~Close the leveling network to multiple external controls and compare common movement with independent GNSS or deep benchmarks; preserve raw readings when a reference is suspect and reconstruct elevations traceably under survey-lead review.||全網基準同時沉陷可能讓所有監測點看似不動，閉合差仍然很小；若只相信內部閉合，累積沉陷會被悄悄從風險圖中扣掉。~Common settlement of the references can make monitored points appear stationary while closure remains small. Trusting internal closure alone silently removes accumulated movement from the risk assessment.
差異沉陷與傾斜~Differential movement and tilt||建物受影響不只看總沉陷，支承間的差異與曲率會誘發結構變形。剛體傾斜與彎曲須分開，因為相同兩點高差可能代表整棟轉動或局部損傷，單一角度不能自動判定損害。~Structural effects depend on differential movement and curvature as well as total settlement. Rigid tilt differs from bending: the same two-point difference may describe whole-building rotation or local distortion, so one angle cannot directly diagnose damage.||假設兩支點距10 m、高差5 mm，角變化Δ/L=0.0005 rad=1/2000；非通用損害門檻。~For assumed support spacing 10 m and differential movement 5 mm, Δ/L=0.0005 rad=1/2000; this is not a universal damage threshold.||將建物角點水準、傾度與裂縫計同步比較，扣除可識別剛體分量後再檢查曲率；容許值由結構型式、既有缺陷及業主要求決定，不能把教學比值當自動停工標準。~Synchronize corner levels, tilt and crack gauges and examine curvature after identifiable rigid-body movement; criteria depend on structure, existing defects and owner requirements, not the teaching ratio as an automatic stop-work limit.||只看最大沉陷可能忽略短距離高梯度，反之大範圍均勻沉陷也可能被誤判為嚴重彎曲；錯誤分類會讓保護措施沒有針對真正受力路徑。~Maximum settlement alone misses steep local gradients, while broad uniform movement may be mistaken for severe bending. Misclassification directs protective measures away from the actual structural load path.
速率與時間窗~Rates and time windows||沉陷速率是差分量，時間窗越短越容易放大量測雜訊，越長則可能抹去施工事件。必須把測讀頻率與可能變形速度相配，並將實際時間間隔保留，不能假設所有測次等間距。~Settlement rate is a difference quotient: short windows amplify noise while long windows obscure events. Sampling must match possible movement speed, retaining actual timestamps rather than assuming equally spaced readings.||假設24 h沉陷增加2 mm，平均速率0.0833 mm/h；若同變化集中在2 h則局部平均1 mm/h。~An assumed 2 mm increase over 24 h averages 0.0833 mm/h; if concentrated within 2 h, the local average is 1 mm/h.||並列原始位移、不同窗長速率與施工事件時間，確認尖峰是否超過儀器噪音；不得平滑後刪除異常，監測負責人應先核對測點狀況，再依核准應變計畫處理持續加速。~Display raw movement, rates from several windows and construction timestamps, checking peaks against noise; do not erase anomalies through smoothing, and verify point condition before applying the approved response plan to sustained acceleration.||時間戳錯誤或漏測可產生假加速度，過長平均又會讓急遽變形延後被發現；將速率與累積量分開審查才能辨識兩種相反風險。~Incorrect timestamps or missed observations create false acceleration, while excessive averaging delays recognition of rapid movement. Reviewing rate and accumulated displacement together is necessary to identify these opposite risks.
精度與差值不確定~Precision of displacement differences||兩次高程相減會累積各測次不確定性，若共享同一儀器校準，誤差還可能相關。解析度只是最小顯示增量，不等於可辨識沉陷；判斷微小變化時需有重複測量與環境補償。~Differencing elevations combines epoch uncertainties, which may correlate through shared calibration. Resolution is only display increment, not detectable settlement. Small changes require repeat observations and environmental checks before interpretation.||假設兩次高程各標準不確定0.5 mm且獨立，差值u=√(0.5²+0.5²)=0.707 mm。~Assuming independent elevation standard uncertainties of 0.5 mm at each epoch, the difference has u=√(0.5²+0.5²)=0.707 mm.||以穩定控制點重複觀測估計實際散布，分離儀器、立尺與環境貢獻；對小於可辨識程度的變化標記不確定，而不是強制畫成平順趨勢，並由測量主管核准資料品質旗標。~Estimate field scatter from repeated stable controls and separate instrument, staff and environmental contributions; flag unresolved small changes instead of forcing a smooth trend, with quality flags approved by the survey lead.||以0.1 mm顯示位數宣稱0.1 mm準確度會過度解讀噪音，若只挑單次最大變化又會製造假警報；反覆誤報可能削弱團隊對真異常的反應。~Claiming 0.1 mm accuracy from display resolution overinterprets noise, while choosing the largest single difference creates false alarms. Repeated false alerts can weaken the response to genuine abnormal movement.
地下水下降與固結~Drawdown and consolidation||水位降低可增加有效應力並引發延時固結，影響範圍未必與即時沉陷槽相同。必須分開孔壓下降與總應力變化，水位穿越土層改變單位重時，簡單γwΔh換算不能直接完整代表。~Drawdown may increase effective stress and cause delayed consolidation beyond the immediate trough. Separate pore-pressure reduction from changing total stress; when a water table crosses layers and changes unit weight, γwΔh alone is incomplete.||假設總應力不變且測點孔壓降低γwΔh，水頭降2 m使Δσ′=9.81×2=19.62 kPa；總重改變須另算。~Assume total stress remains fixed and point pore pressure falls by γwΔh; a 2 m head drop gives Δσ′=19.62 kPa, requiring separate treatment if total weight changes.||將多深度孔壓、地表沉陷與抽排水量同步，檢查沉陷是否在開挖通過後仍持續；以壓縮性試驗與排水邊界分析時間尺度，不能只憑兩條相似曲線宣稱因果。~Synchronize multilevel pore pressure, settlement and pumping, checking whether movement persists after passage; use compressibility tests and drainage boundaries to assess timescale rather than inferring causality from two similar curves alone.||把延時固結全歸為潛盾出土過多會選錯控制手段，反之將局部失土都當地下水效應又可能延誤處置；需要水文與施工證據共同辨識。~Attributing all consolidation to excess muck removal selects the wrong control, while blaming localized ground loss on groundwater can delay action. Hydraulic and construction evidence are needed together.
施工里程與多源事件~Chainage and multiple events||同一監測點可能受雙線隧道、車站開挖、灌漿與外部施工影響，位移對時間曲線需要連到各事件位置。將所有變化歸給最近掌子面會忽略延時與重疊，應建立可比較的事件索引。~A point may respond to twin drives, station excavation, grouting and unrelated works. Time histories must connect to each event location. Assigning every change to the nearest face ignores delay and overlap, requiring a comparable event index.||假設掌子面距測點30 m、隧道直徑6 m，規一化距離x/D=5；兩條線比較需同樣定義正負方向。~For assumed face distance 30 m and diameter 6 m, normalized distance x/D=5; comparing drives requires the same sign convention.||把位移同時對時間與規一化掌子面距離作圖，加入灌漿及抽水日誌；多事件重疊時比較未受同一事件影響的控制點，地工主管需列出可能成因及可區分它們的證據。~Plot movement against both time and normalized face distance, including grouting and pumping logs; use suitable control points during overlapping events and require the geotechnical lead to list competing causes and distinguishing evidence.||錯誤時區或機器里程會將沉陷峰錯配施工階段，雙線效果重疊又可能被誤當第二條線單獨造成；這會扭曲事後經驗參數與責任判斷。~Wrong time zones or machine chainage misassign settlement peaks to stages; overlapping twin-drive effects can be attributed entirely to the second drive, biasing empirical parameters and retrospective responsibility assessments.
警戒邏輯與量測確認~Trigger logic and measurement confirmation||警戒值應連到可執行的回應與量測確認流程，而非只有紅黃綠色。位移、速率與結構症狀提供不同證據，持續超限和單點跳值需分辨，但不能以資料確認為由延誤已核准的緊急回應。~Triggers require actionable responses and measurement confirmation, not only colors. Displacement, rate and structural symptoms provide different evidence; distinguish persistent exceedance from isolated jumps without delaying an approved emergency response.||假設教學警戒比r=量測8 mm/審查值10 mm=0.8；此10 mm純為算例，現場需個案核准。~An assumed teaching trigger ratio is measured 8 mm/review value 10 mm=0.8; the 10 mm value is purely illustrative and requires project-specific approval in practice.||用模擬資料演練超限通知、備援讀值與責任人接收，確認通訊斷線也會被標示；工程師審查門檻的依據、延遲與可採行措施，不能把本課比值部署成現場控制表。~Rehearse notification, backup readings and acknowledgment with synthetic data, including communication loss; engineers review criteria, latency and feasible actions, and the teaching ratio must not be deployed as a field control table.||只依平均值判斷可能掩蓋單一敏感建物，儀器斷線被當成零位移更危險；若警報沒有指定接收者，即使系統正確偵測也未必產生回應。~Averages can hide one sensitive building, and treating lost communication as zero movement is worse. Without a named recipient, technically correct detection may still fail to produce a response.
長期追蹤與結案~Long-term tracking and closeout||施工通過不代表所有沉陷立即停止，黏土固結及地下水恢復可能延續。結案需有基準穩定、速率趨勢和建物狀況的共同證據，並保留後續營運期能銜接的坐標與時間基準。~Passage does not end settlement immediately; clay consolidation and groundwater recovery can continue. Closeout needs stable references, rate trends and asset condition together, preserving coordinates and time datums for operational monitoring.||假設連續四週增量0.8、0.4、0.2、0.1 mm，總增量1.5 mm；遞減趨勢不等於未來必定為零。~Assumed weekly increments 0.8,0.4,0.2 and 0.1 mm total 1.5 mm; a decreasing trend does not prove zero future movement.||以固定方法檢查長期讀值、孔壓恢復和既有裂縫，說明監測停止或降頻的個案依據；交付原始資料、校正歷程與未解決項，由業主及工程負責人共同確認接管條件。~Review long-term levels, pressure recovery and existing cracks consistently, justifying any reduced frequency or cessation; deliver raw data, corrections and unresolved issues for joint owner and engineering approval of handover conditions.||過早拆除基準會切斷延時沉陷的證據鏈，若只交最後讀值則無法追查速率；未明示剩餘不確定性，營運者可能誤以為已證實永久穩定。~Removing benchmarks prematurely breaks evidence for delayed movement, while final readings alone lose rate history. Unstated residual uncertainty can lead an operator to assume that permanent stability has been demonstrated.
''')
 compact('b133','用多方向位移、量測基準與支護時序辨識隧道收斂機制~Identify convergence mechanisms through multidirectional movement, survey references and support timing',['central-line-deformation','crossrail-monitoring'],r'''
收斂弦長與方向~Convergence chords and direction||收斂弦量到兩點間距變化，不等於每點的絕對位移。水平弦縮短可能來自側壁內移或整個斷面轉動，只有加入垂直、斜向弦與坐標才能分辨對稱擠壓及偏壓。~A convergence chord measures separation change, not absolute movement at either endpoint. Horizontal shortening may reflect inward movement or section rotation; vertical and diagonal chords plus coordinates distinguish symmetric squeezing from asymmetric loading.||假設原弦長8.000 m、後為7.988 m，收斂12 mm、相對應變12/8000=0.0015。~An assumed chord shortening from 8.000 to 7.988 m gives convergence 12 mm and relative strain 12/8000=0.0015.||用多條不共線弦與全測站坐標同時檢查，核對測釘是否牢固連到代表性支護；依設計預測方向比較位移向量，不用單一水平弦直接判定整個斷面均勻收縮。~Compare several noncollinear chords with total-station coordinates and check that targets represent stable support locations; compare vectors with predicted directions rather than inferring uniform section shrinkage from one horizontal chord.||兩端測釘一起平移時弦長不變，卻可能已發生整體偏移；測釘局部鬆脫又可製造假收斂，若沒有絕對坐標便難以辨別兩者。~Both targets can translate together with unchanged chord length despite substantial section movement. A loose target can instead create false convergence, difficult to distinguish without independent coordinates.
初始讀值與已發生變形~Initial readings and prior movement||量測只能看到首讀之後的變化，掌子面到達與裝設測點之間已發生的位移不在紀錄內。首讀里程、時間與支護狀態需一起保存，否則不同斷面會因量測起點不同而看似岩性差異。~Monitoring captures movement after the first reading, omitting displacement before installation. Preserve initial face distance, time and support state; otherwise different monitoring origins can masquerade as geological differences between sections.||假設首讀前已收斂6 mm、之後量得14 mm，總估計20 mm；缺失初期量占30%，須明列為推估。~Assume 6 mm convergence before the first reading and 14 mm afterward; estimated total is 20 mm, with 30% explicitly inferred rather than measured.||對照開挖及支護日誌記錄首讀延遲，以相同面距或模型比較斷面；初期缺失量只能用經驗或分析給區間，不能回填成實測點，主管工程師需確認這種修正的用途。~Record first-reading delay against excavation and support logs and compare sections at matching face distance or through a model; missing early movement receives an inferred interval, never fabricated measured points, with engineering approval of its use.||晚裝測點的斷面可能看似變形最小而被判成最穩定，實際大部分已發生；以此降低支護會把量測時序偏差誤當地層改善。~A late-installed section can appear most stable because much movement occurred before monitoring. Reducing support on that basis mistakes installation timing for improved ground conditions.
角度精度與觀測距離~Angular precision and sight distance||全測站角度誤差隨觀測距離轉成線性位置誤差，長視線不一定有更好的收斂精度。隧道熱流、折射與遮擋又造成非隨機偏差，必須把儀器標稱值和現場重複性分開。~Total-station angular error becomes a distance-dependent position error. Long sights therefore need not improve convergence precision, and tunnel thermal refraction and obstruction add nonrandom bias beyond the nominal instrument rating.||假設視距100 m、角度誤差5 arcsec，線性誤差100×5/206265=0.00242 m=2.42 mm。~For assumed sight distance 100 m and angular error 5 arcsec, linear error is 100×5/206265=0.00242 m=2.42 mm.||以不同設站、正倒鏡及穩定參考點重複觀測，記錄溫度梯度與可視條件；將現場重複散布和預期變形量比較，若噪音同量級則需調整測網而非增加輸出小數位。~Repeat observations from different stations and faces with stable references and document thermal and visibility conditions; compare field scatter with expected movement, redesigning the network rather than adding decimals when they are comparable.||暖風造成的折射會讓相同方向測點共同偏移，系統可能把它解讀成斷面傾斜；只靠單一測站的內部精度指標無法發現這種偏差。~Thermal refraction can move targets coherently in one direction and mimic section tilt. Internal precision statistics from one station cannot reveal that shared directional error.
鋼尺溫度與張力~Tape temperature and tension||收斂尺量長受熱膨脹、拉力及垂度影響，讀值變化不必然是岩體運動。應使用校正條件換算到共同基準，且確認標距和接頭重複定位，否則日夜溫差會形成假的週期變形。~Tape length responds to temperature, tension and sag as well as ground movement. Convert readings to a common calibration condition and verify gauge length and seating, or day-night temperature variation will mimic cyclic convergence.||假設鋼尺α=12×10⁻⁶/K、長10 m、溫差10 K，ΔL=αLΔT=1.2 mm；未含垂度。~Assume steel-tape α=12×10⁻⁶/K, length 10 m and temperature change 10 K; ΔL=1.2 mm, excluding sag.||在固定基線檢查尺長及重複張力，記錄量測時尺體溫度而非只用遠處氣溫；保留原讀值與各修正項，以獨立光學量測核對，修正後仍異常才作地工解釋。~Check tape length and repeatable tension on a fixed baseline and record tape temperature rather than distant air temperature; retain raw readings and corrections and compare optical observations before interpreting persistent anomalies geotechnically.||溫度補償符號用反會把膨脹加倍，量測人員張力不同又可造成班次跳值；若未查校正紀錄，就可能對不存在的變形採取施工調整。~A reversed temperature correction doubles thermal error, while inconsistent tension produces shift changes. Missing calibration review may prompt construction changes in response to movement that never occurred.
參考點穩定與共模~Reference stability and common motion||洞內設站點也可能隨開挖移動，所有測點共模位移可能來自設站而非圍岩。測網需連到影響區外控制，並利用相對弦長與絕對坐標互查，使局部變形和整體基準漂移可分辨。~Underground stations can move during excavation, creating common apparent displacement. Link the network to external controls and compare relative chords with absolute coordinates to distinguish local distortion from reference drift.||假設三點皆向右5 mm且弦長不變，可能為共同平移；差分位移5−5=0 mm，不能據此宣稱絕對不動。~If three assumed targets all move 5 mm right with unchanged chords, their differential movement is zero; this does not demonstrate absolute stability.||檢查外部控制與設站殘差，重算以不同基準約束的位移場；對共模與差分量分別報告，任何基準重設須保存轉換矩陣並經測量主管核准，避免歷程被強制歸零。~Inspect external controls and station residuals and recompute with alternative reference constraints; report common and differential motion separately and retain approved transformation matrices for any datum reset instead of forcing the history to zero.||把設站漂移當偏壓會誤改支護，反過來將真實整體位移一律扣除也會掩蓋隧道移動；只保留校正後曲線無法查明哪種情況發生。~Mistaking station drift for asymmetric ground pressure misdirects support, while subtracting all common motion can hide real tunnel translation. Corrected curves alone cannot establish which situation occurred.
面距與變形速率~Face distance and movement rate||靠近掌子面的三維支承效應隨面距消退，收斂對時間的變化也受開挖停頓影響。把位移同時對時間與面距繪圖，才能區分施工推進造成的釋放與岩體持續潛變。~Three-dimensional face restraint diminishes with distance, while stoppages alter convergence versus time. Plotting movement against both time and face distance separates advance-related release from continuing rock creep.||假設收斂由8增至11 mm歷時6 h，平均0.5 mm/h；同期面進3 m，空間增率1 mm/m。~An assumed convergence increase from 8 to 11 mm over 6 h gives 0.5 mm/h; with 3 m advance, the spatial increment is 1 mm/m.||同步掌子面里程、支護完成時刻與位移資料，對照停工時段是否仍有變形；以多斷面比較一致面距的行為，速率變化需連到實際事件而非只用等時間插值資料。~Synchronize face chainage, support completion and movement and inspect behavior during stoppages; compare sections at matching face distances and relate rate changes to actual events rather than uniformly interpolated time series.||快速推進時密集釋放可能被誤當加速潛變，長期停工後的持續收斂又可能被低頻量測漏掉；兩者需要不同的地工解釋與審查。~Rapid advance-related release can be mistaken for accelerating creep, while continuing movement during long stoppages may be missed by infrequent readings. These cases require different geotechnical interpretations and review.
支護接觸與剛度~Support contact and stiffness||襯砌只有與圍岩有效接觸並形成受力路徑後才提供約束，間隙閉合前的收斂未必反映材料柔弱。早齡混凝土剛度隨時間變化，收斂減慢也可能是支護成熟而非地層改善。~Lining restrains ground only after contact and a load path form; movement before gap closure need not indicate weak material. Early-age stiffness changes with time, so slower convergence can reflect support maturation rather than improved geology.||假設等效線性支護k=20 MN/m、接觸後位移2 mm，反力F=kδ=40 kN；接觸前不可使用此式。~Assume equivalent linear support stiffness k=20 MN/m and post-contact movement 2 mm; F=kδ=40 kN, inapplicable before contact.||把收斂與支護齡期、厚度、接縫及接觸檢查相連，必要時以應變或荷重資料交叉確認；設計者需驗證剛度模型及有效受力寬度，不直接將單點位移乘任意剛度當全環載重。~Relate convergence to age, thickness, joints and contact, cross-checking strain or load where appropriate; the designer verifies stiffness and effective width instead of multiplying one displacement by arbitrary stiffness to infer whole-ring load.||有空隙時先套線性支護會高估早期反力，反之忽略成熟剛度又可能低估後期受力；收斂小也不能證明襯砌應力低。~Applying linear support across a gap overestimates early reaction, while ignoring maturing stiffness can underestimate later force. Small convergence therefore does not prove low lining stress.
斷面橢圓化模式~Section ovalization patterns||直徑在一方向縮短而另一方向增加，可能是橢圓化而非均勻收縮。幾何模式與接縫轉動、局部載重及圍岩不均有關，需保留整圈向量，避免單點最大值掩蓋成對變化。~Shortening one diameter while another grows suggests ovalization rather than uniform shrinkage. The mode depends on joint rotation, local loads and uneven ground, requiring full-perimeter vectors instead of only the largest single reading.||假設水平直徑6.000變5.990 m、垂直變6.006 m，差異橢圓化幅16 mm；定義須固定。~Assume horizontal diameter changes from 6.000 to 5.990 m while vertical becomes 6.006 m; the diameter difference is 16 mm under this stated ovalization definition.||用多方位反射鏡或掃描斷面擬合低階變形模式，與接縫張開及裂縫位置比較；同時報告剛體平移與形狀變化，掃描配準不得將真正的低階變形吸收到座標轉換。~Fit low-order modes to multiple targets or scanned profiles and compare joint opening and cracks; report rigid translation separately from shape change and prevent scan registration from absorbing genuine low-order deformation.||僅量水平弦會漏掉頂底張開，最佳擬合圓又可能平均掉橢圓化；若因此宣稱斷面尺寸正常，接縫防水及局部彎矩風險會被忽略。~A horizontal chord alone misses vertical opening, and a best-fit circle averages away ovalization. Declaring normal geometry from that fit can overlook joint-waterproofing and local bending risks.
資料延遲與回應~Data latency and response||自動量測的價值取決於資料到達決策者的時間，感測器頻率高卻傳輸延遲仍可能錯過趨勢。資料品質、缺測與超限必須各自有狀態，不能把沒有新資料顯示成穩定綠燈。~Automated monitoring depends on time to decision, not sensor frequency alone. High-rate acquisition with delayed transmission can miss actionable trends. Quality, missing data and exceedance need distinct states rather than presenting silence as stable green status.||假設採樣5 min、傳輸延遲10 min、審查15 min，最壞單次等待尺度為30 min；未含重測時間。~Assume sampling interval 5 min, transmission delay 10 min and review 15 min; a worst-case single-cycle waiting scale is 30 min, excluding remeasurement.||以模擬超限和斷線資料測通知、備援與責任人確認時間，核對時間戳是否使用同一時區；監測計畫需將延遲與可能變形速率比較，回應條件由主管工程師與施工團隊核准。~Test alerts, backups and acknowledgment using simulated exceedance and dropout, checking a common timestamp zone; compare latency with plausible movement rate and obtain engineering and construction approval of the response conditions.||伺服器重送舊數據若被當新測次，曲線會看似平穩且持續更新；沒有資料新鮮度警告時，真正加速收斂可能一直無人察覺。~If a server retransmits old values as new readings, the trend looks stable and continuously updated. Without a freshness warning, genuine accelerating convergence can remain undetected despite an active dashboard.
收斂反分析與交接~Convergence back-analysis and handover||位移反分析可能由不同剛度與荷重組合得到相似曲線，故參數不一定唯一。應結合地質、支護應變及施工時序限制解空間，交接報告保留可替代解釋，讓後續工程知道哪些推論仍需驗證。~Different stiffness-load combinations can fit similar convergence histories, making back-analysis nonunique. Geology, support strain and construction sequence constrain solutions; handover retains alternative interpretations and identifies what still requires verification.||假設模型A與B都預測10 mm但實測10.5 mm，兩者殘差皆0.5 mm；相同擬合誤差不能證明機制相同。~If assumed models A and B predict 10 mm against 10.5 mm observed, both residuals are 0.5 mm; equal fit error does not establish the same mechanism.||保留校準用與獨立驗證用斷面，檢查模型能否預測未參與擬合的時間或位置；交接量測原始檔、參數範圍與失效條件，由設計及監測負責人共同確認可外推範圍。~Separate calibration and independent validation sections and test predictions at unused times or locations; hand over raw measurements, parameter ranges and invalidation conditions for joint design and monitoring approval of extrapolation limits.||用同一曲線調參又宣稱驗證會高估預測力，僅靠位移擬合可能選中錯誤荷重路徑；新地層或新支護階段一出現，模型便失去可靠性。~Calibrating and validating on the same curve exaggerates predictive ability. Displacement-only fitting may select the wrong load path and fail as soon as geology or the support stage changes.
''')
 source('usgs-photogrammetry','攝影測量相機系統與獨立精度檢查','Camera system considerations for geomorphic applications of SfM photogrammetry','US Geological Survey','https://www.usgs.gov/publications/camera-system-considerations-geomorphic-applications-sfm-photogrammetry','政府研究者對影像品質與獨立檢核點的研究；本課將一般幾何原理用於隧道場景，非聲稱原研究在隧道實施。','Government research on image quality and independent check points; the course applies general geometry to tunnels, without claiming the original study was underground.')
 source('herrenknecht-epb','土壓平衡潛盾原理','Earth pressure balance shield principles','Herrenknecht','https://www.herrenknecht.com.cn/produkte/productdetail/%E5%9C%9F%E5%8E%8B%E5%B9%B3%E8%A1%A1%E5%BC%8F%E7%9B%BE%E6%9E%84%E6%9C%BA/','製造商公開的土倉支護、出土與土壤改良機制；不提供操作設定或配方。','Manufacturer overview of chamber support, extraction and ground conditioning, without operating settings or recipes.')
 source('herrenknecht-mixshield','混合式泥水潛盾原理','Mixshield principles','Herrenknecht','https://www.herrenknecht.com.cn/produkte/productdetail/%E6%B7%B7%E5%90%88%E5%BC%8F%E7%9B%BE%E6%9E%84%E6%9C%BA/','製造商公開的泥水支護與氣墊壓力補償背景，供系統比較。','Manufacturer context on slurry support and air-cushion pressure compensation for system comparison.')
 compact('b134','以影像幾何、尺度控制與獨立檢核重建可追溯的掌子面模型~Reconstruct a traceable face model through image geometry, scale control and independent checks',['usgs-photogrammetry','amberg-survey'],r'''
像素尺度與可見細節~Pixel scale and visible detail||地面取樣距離由距離、像素尺寸與焦距決定，像素小不等於實際幾何精度高。鏡頭模糊、影像雜訊及岩面紋理會限制可辨特徵，裂隙寬度低於有效分辨率時只能記為未解析。~Ground sampling distance depends on range, pixel size and focal length, but small pixels do not ensure accurate geometry. Blur, noise and rock texture limit discernible features, and subresolution cracks must remain unresolved.||假設距離5 m、像素5 μm、焦距25 mm，GSD=Zp/f=1 mm/pixel；非三維精度保證。~Assume range 5 m, pixel pitch 5 μm and focal length 25 mm; GSD=Zp/f=1 mm/pixel, not a guarantee of three-dimensional accuracy.||用已知尺度標記檢查影像實際取樣距離，觀察岩面細紋是否清晰；把像素尺度與獨立檢核點誤差分開報告，避免把輸出點雲密度當成可辨識裂隙寬度。~Check actual image scale with known targets and inspect fine surface texture; report pixel spacing separately from independent checkpoint error rather than treating point-cloud density as resolved fracture width.||放大影像或提高輸出點數不會增加原始資訊，若把插值表面當成實測細節，可能畫出不存在的薄層或誤判節理是否閉合。~Enlargement and denser output do not create source information. Treating an interpolated surface as measured detail can invent thin layers or misclassify whether a discontinuity is closed.
立體基線與深度~Stereo baseline and depth||不同視點的視差提供深度，基線過小使深度對像點誤差非常敏感，過大則減少共同可見紋理。拍攝幾何需要兼顧角度交會與遮擋，單純增加照片數不能補救全部來自同一位置。~Parallax from different viewpoints yields depth. A short baseline amplifies image error, while a long one loses common texture. Geometry must balance intersection angle and occlusion; many photographs from one position do not solve the problem.||假設Z=5 m、f=5000 pixel、B=1 m、視差誤差0.5 pixel，σZ≈Z²σd/(fB)=2.5 mm。~Assume Z=5 m, f=5000 pixels, B=1 m and disparity error 0.5 pixel; σZ≈Z²σd/(fB)=2.5 mm.||繪製相機位置與連接網，檢查是否存在足夠交會角和共同特徵；以未參與解算的深度檢核點測試模型，若深度誤差顯著大於平面誤差，先查幾何而非只調演算法參數。~Inspect camera positions and tie connections for adequate intersection angles and shared features; test depth with unused checkpoints, investigating acquisition geometry before algorithm tuning when depth errors greatly exceed lateral errors.||低視差影像仍可產生平滑漂亮點雲，但深度可能整體漂移；若因此估算超挖或節理面方向，幾何弱點會直接轉成工程判斷偏差。~Low-parallax imagery can yield an attractive smooth cloud with biased depth. Overbreak estimates and joint orientations derived from it inherit the poorly constrained geometry rather than reliable engineering evidence.
相機校準與畸變~Camera calibration and distortion||焦距、主點與鏡頭畸變共同控制射線方向，自校準需要足夠幾何多樣性才能辨識。全部照片近似共面或相機變焦，容易讓畸變與地表彎曲互相補償，形成看似低殘差的錯誤模型。~Focal length, principal point and distortion govern rays. Self-calibration needs geometric diversity; near-planar views or changing zoom can trade lens distortion against surface curvature, producing a wrong model with low residuals.||假設徑向畸變模型Δr=k1r³，r=1000 pixel、k1=10⁻⁹ pixel⁻²，Δr=1 pixel；單位須一致。~For assumed radial distortion Δr=k1r³ with r=1000 pixels and k1=10⁻⁹ pixel⁻², Δr=1 pixel; units must remain consistent.||固定焦距與對焦狀態並保留原始EXIF，對照校準板及不同方位影像；檢查像面殘差是否呈徑向系統圖樣，獨立檢核仍有曲面偏差時，不以低重投影誤差直接驗收。~Fix and document focal and focus state with original EXIF, comparing calibration targets and varied views; inspect radial residual patterns and do not accept low reprojection error when independent checks retain systematic surface curvature.||將不同變焦狀態合成同一相機模型會扭曲比例，強行過擬合畸變又會吸收真正岩面起伏；兩者都可能在控制點附近看似準確而邊緣失真。~Combining zoom states under one camera model distorts scale, while overfitted distortion absorbs genuine relief. Both can look accurate near controls yet deform the edges of the face model.
尺度與控制點布置~Scale and control distribution||影像匹配本身只決定相對幾何，實際尺寸與方向需由可靠控制資訊固定。控制點若全擠在一角，模型其他區域仍可能傾斜或彎曲，應分布於可觀測範圍並保留獨立檢核點。~Image matching determines relative geometry; reliable control establishes dimensions and orientation. Controls clustered in one corner leave other areas free to tilt or warp, so distribute them across the observable region and reserve independent checks.||假設真實標距2.000 m被重建為1.990 m，尺度修正2.000/1.990=1.00503；仍不能修正局部翹曲。~An assumed true distance 2.000 m reconstructed as 1.990 m requires scale factor 1.00503; that factor cannot correct local warping.||以獨立測量取得控制坐標與不確定度，將控制及檢核分組並畫分布圖；驗收不只看控制殘差，也檢查遠離控制區的檢核點，缺乏覆蓋的區域須標示較低可信度。~Survey control coordinates and uncertainties independently and map separate control and check groups; acceptance includes checkpoints away from controls, with lower confidence explicitly marked where spatial coverage is inadequate.||只用一根比例尺可固定尺度卻不能充分控制三維姿態，控制點錯標又可能使整個模型鏡射或扭轉；平均殘差小仍可能藏住局部大誤差。~One scale bar fixes scale without fully constraining pose, and mislabeled controls may twist or mirror the model. Small average residuals can still conceal large local errors beyond the controlled region.
照明與濕壁反光~Lighting and wet-wall reflections||攝影匹配假設同一紋理在不同視角仍可辨識，濕岩反光會隨視點移動而違反此假設。陰影、粉塵及過曝也會抹去特徵，需先評估影像品質再談高密度重建。~Matching assumes recognizable texture across viewpoints. Wet-rock highlights move with viewpoint and violate that assumption, while shadows, dust and saturation erase features. Assess source-image quality before requesting dense reconstruction.||假設影像有200萬有效岩面像素，其中20萬過曝，過曝率10%；不能將其插值面視為直接量測。~If an assumed 2000000 face pixels include 200000 saturated pixels, saturation is 10%; interpolated surfaces there are not direct measurements.||檢查直方圖、過曝遮罩與不同視角的反光位置，記錄照明與濕潤狀態；同一構造需在多張清晰影像確認，無紋理區保留空洞或低信心標記，不以自動補洞掩蓋缺資料。~Inspect histograms, saturation masks and viewpoint-dependent highlights and record lighting and moisture; confirm features in multiple clear images and retain gaps or low confidence in textureless zones rather than hiding missing evidence with hole filling.||反光亮點被當成固定特徵會產生漂浮點，濕壁暗帶也可能被誤判為裂隙；若平滑後直接匯出，錯誤來源會被漂亮表面掩蓋。~Highlights treated as fixed features produce floating points, while wet dark bands mimic fractures. Smoothing before export can hide both artifacts behind a visually convincing surface.
遮擋與可見範圍~Occlusion and visible coverage||岩塊凸出會遮住其後凹面，多視點可改善卻不能保證全部可見。點雲孔洞應區分不可見、低紋理和處理失敗，因為缺測背面可能恰好控制塊體厚度與可動方向。~Protruding blocks hide recesses; additional viewpoints help without guaranteeing complete coverage. Distinguish occlusion, poor texture and processing failure because an unseen back surface may control block thickness and movement direction.||假設掌子面50 m²中實際重建42 m²，可見重建率84%；餘8 m²不能按平均表面直接補成穩定。~For an assumed 50 m² face with 42 m² reconstructed, coverage is 84%; the remaining 8 m² cannot be filled with an average surface and declared stable.||以原始照片及視線圖查核點雲空洞，對不易看見的頂拱區單列覆蓋；只有在核准安全觀測位置取得補充資料，不能因追求模型完整而接近未支護掌子面。~Review gaps against original images and visibility rays, reporting crown coverage separately; supplementary observations must use approved safe locations, never approaching an unsupported face merely to complete a model.||自動封閉網格可能把凹穴填平而低估超挖，也可能虛構塊體背面；模型封閉並不代表已取得完整幾何，現場判斷仍須知道不可見處。~Automatic mesh closure fills recesses and underestimates overbreak or invents block backs. A closed model therefore does not mean complete observed geometry, and engineering interpretation must retain visibility limits.
重投影與獨立精度~Reprojection versus independent accuracy||重投影殘差衡量影像方程內部一致，不能單獨代表物件坐標精度。錯誤尺度或共同控制偏差仍可有很小殘差，必須使用未參與最佳化的檢核資料評估外部準確性。~Reprojection residual measures internal image consistency, not object-space accuracy. Wrong scale or common control bias can coexist with small residuals, requiring independent observations excluded from optimization to assess external accuracy.||假設三個檢核誤差1、2、2 mm，RMSE=√((1+4+4)/3)=1.73 mm；不等於最大誤差。~For assumed checkpoint errors 1,2 and 2 mm, RMSE=√((1+4+4)/3)=1.73 mm; this is not the maximum error.||分別報告像素殘差、三維檢核誤差與最大局部偏差，註明檢核點是否獨立；將模型與全測站或雷射掃描在同一坐標比較，系統性方向誤差需先查基準再談平均精度。~Report pixel residual, three-dimensional checkpoint error and maximum local discrepancy separately with checkpoint independence; compare surveying or laser scanning in a common frame and investigate systematic directional error before claiming average accuracy.||把控制點同時當檢核點會誇大精度，模型又可能在少數點附近過擬合；若只報平均誤差，邊緣失真會被良好中心區大量資料沖淡。~Reusing controls as checkpoints exaggerates accuracy and can hide local overfitting. Reporting only an average also dilutes distorted edges with numerous good observations from the center of the model.
節理平面與法向~Joint planes and normals||點雲擬合平面可取得節理方向，但選取區域混入多個面時，最小平方只得到折衷面。粗糙度與測量噪音都進入殘差，應檢查法向穩定性及實際地質連續性。~A fitted plane yields joint orientation, but combining several surfaces produces a least-squares compromise. Roughness and measurement noise both contribute residuals, requiring normal stability checks and geological evidence of continuity.||假設平面法向量(0,0.6,0.8)已單位化，與鉛直夾角acos0.8=36.87°，即此平面傾角。~For assumed unit normal (0,0.6,0.8), angle to vertical acos0.8=36.87° gives the plane dip under this convention.||改變選面範圍與抽樣密度檢查法向是否穩定，並以人工地質描線核對是否同一節理；法向需轉到工程坐標且保留正反向約定，不能將表面法向誤作傾向方位。~Vary selection extent and sampling density to test normal stability and compare geological traces; transform to engineering coordinates with a stated sign convention, avoiding confusion between the normal vector and dip-direction azimuth.||跨越兩面擬合會生成現場不存在的中間傾角，細密點群偏重一側又會支配結果；由此做楔體分析可能漏掉真正交線或創造假楔體。~Fitting across two planes invents an intermediate dip, and dense points on one side bias the result. Wedge analysis may then miss the true intersection or manufacture a nonexistent block.
重複測量與變化偵測~Repeat surveys and change detection||兩次點雲差值同時包含真實變化與配準誤差，不能把每個非零距離當作岩塊移動。表面法向方向的比較與共同穩定區很重要，配準若包含變形面會把真位移吸收。~Cloud differences combine real change and registration error, so nonzero distance alone does not prove movement. Compare along suitable surface normals using stable areas; registration against deforming surfaces can absorb the true displacement.||假設兩期表面標準不確定各2 mm且獨立，差值u=2.83 mm；約95%正態尺度1.96u=5.54 mm。~Assume independent surface uncertainties of 2 mm per epoch; difference u=2.83 mm and an approximate 95% normal scale is 1.96u=5.54 mm.||以外部穩定控制配準並保存變換參數，對相同可見區比較法向距離；結合局部粗糙度與誤差界線標示可辨變化，非正態或相關誤差時不得直接沿用本課95%係數。~Register using stable external controls and retain transformations, comparing normal distances over shared visible areas; combine roughness with uncertainty to flag detectable change, avoiding the illustrative 95% factor under correlated or nonnormal errors.||使用全部面點最佳擬合會把整片岩面移動抵消，照明造成的重建差異又可能假裝剝落；沒有共視遮罩時缺測區會產生巨大的假變化。~Best-fitting all face points can cancel whole-surface movement, while lighting-driven reconstruction differences mimic spalling. Missing common-visibility masks create large false changes where one epoch has no observations.
模型證據與安全交接~Model evidence and safe handover||掌子面模型是地質記錄工具，不能替代現場支護與穩定判斷。交接須包含影像、坐標、檢核、可見範圍和拍攝時刻，讓後續設計知道模型對應哪次開挖及哪些部分只是插值。~A face model documents geology rather than replacing support or stability decisions. Handover includes images, datum, checks, visibility and capture time so designers know the excavation round represented and which surfaces are interpolated.||假設10項交接資料有9項齊備，完整率90%；缺少坐標基準這1項仍可使整個模型不可整合。~If 9 of an assumed 10 handover items are complete, completeness is 90%; one missing coordinate datum can still make the entire model unusable for integration.||從報告中的一條節理追查至原照片與選點，抽驗坐標及拍攝里程；測量與地質主管共同確認可用範圍，影像可取得不代表允許接近掌子面，所有補拍遵守核准現場觀測程序。~Trace a reported joint to original images and picks and audit coordinates and capture chainage; survey and geology leads jointly approve use limits, while supplementary photography remains subject to approved site observation procedures.||只交付彩色網格會失去重算與查錯能力，模型與施工里程錯配又會讓支護判讀針對前一回合岩面；視覺逼真並不能彌補證據鏈缺失。~A colored mesh alone loses reconstruction and auditability. Mismatched chainage may direct support interpretation to the previous excavation round, and visual realism cannot compensate for the missing evidence chain.
''')
 compact('b135','以土水作用、支護壓力梯度與失土證據界定軟土開挖面模型~Bound soft-ground face models using soil-water interaction, pressure gradients and ground-loss evidence',['herrenknecht-epb','herrenknecht-mixshield'],r'''
總應力與有效應力~Total and effective stress||軟土開挖面受骨架應力與孔隙水共同作用，短期不排水黏土和排水砂土需要不同強度描述。把土水壓力合併成單一數值再任意扣減，容易重複計入或遺漏孔壓。~Face loading combines skeleton stress and pore water. Short-term undrained clay and drained sand require different strength descriptions; merging everything into one pressure and then subtracting arbitrarily can double-count or omit water effects.||假設總法向應力300 kPa、孔壓180 kPa，有效應力120 kPa；這只是應力分解，不是支護壓力設定。~Assumed total normal stress 300 kPa and pore pressure 180 kPa give effective stress 120 kPa; this is decomposition, not a support-pressure setting.||以分層地質、地下水與試驗排水條件建立參數表，將模型採總應力或有效應力明確標示；設計審查逐項追查水壓是否只計一次，並用合理水位範圍測敏感度。~Build parameter tables from stratigraphy, groundwater and drainage conditions, explicitly labeling total- or effective-stress analysis; review water accounting to ensure it appears once and test a plausible groundwater range.||將不排水強度與排水摩擦角混在同一破壞面會失去物理一致，重複扣孔壓則低估有效約束；算式看似完整卻不能支援可靠穩定判斷。~Mixing undrained strength with drained friction on one failure surface breaks physical consistency. Subtracting pressure twice underestimates confinement, leaving a complete-looking calculation without a defensible stability interpretation.
壓力梯度與高度~Pressure gradient with height||倉內支護介質有自重，頂部與底部壓力不同，而地層與水壓梯度也未必相同。只控制單一感測器讀值不能保證全掌子面均衡，必須把所有讀值換算到共同高度再比較分布。~Support medium has weight, creating different crown and invert pressures, while soil and groundwater gradients may differ. One sensor does not prove full-face balance; readings need a common elevation and a distribution comparison.||假設介質密度1500 kg/m³、垂直高差6 m，Δp=ρgΔz=88.29 kPa；非整面穩定所需壓差。~For assumed medium density 1500 kg/m³ and vertical difference 6 m, Δp=ρgΔz=88.29 kPa; this is not the required stability-pressure range.||核對壓力計高程、零點與介質密度，將多高度讀值畫成梯度並對照理論；若梯度異常需查分層、氣泡或堵塞，經設計及設備主管評估後才可解讀成地層壓力變化。~Check sensor elevation, zero and medium density, plotting multiheight readings against the expected gradient; investigate segregation, air or blockage before design and equipment leads interpret an anomaly as changing ground pressure.||以底部壓力代表頂部會高估頂拱支護，密度分層又使線性換算失準；局部失穩可能在平均壓力看似正常時開始，不能只盯總平均。~Using invert pressure for the crown overstates crown support, while density stratification invalidates a linear conversion. Local instability can begin with a normal-looking mean pressure, making averages insufficient.
覆土與上舉邊界~Cover and uplift boundaries||支護不足可能造成坍入，過大壓力也可能推動淺覆土上舉或形成逸流。穩定分析需要上下兩側機制而不是只求最低值，鄰近地面荷載與弱層會改變可行範圍。~Insufficient support can cause collapse, while excessive pressure may lift shallow cover or create escape paths. Analysis needs both lower and upper mechanisms, with surface loads and weak layers affecting the feasible interval.||假設均質覆土重度18 kN/m³、厚8 m，自重應力144 kPa；此量級檢查未計拱效應、黏聚或水。~Assumed uniform cover unit weight 18 kN/m³ over 8 m gives 144 kPa overburden; this scale check excludes arching, cohesion and water.||用地形、建物載重與地下管線資料檢查淺覆土區，並列坍入及上舉情境；設計者須給出場址專屬模型和審查界線，課程自重值不得當機器壓力目標。~Check shallow cover against terrain, building loads and utilities and analyze collapse and uplift separately; designers provide site-specific models and review boundaries, and the teaching overburden value is not a machine target.||只提高支護壓力來追求防坍會忽略上舉與地表噴出路徑，薄弱夾層可能先被打通；若未有上限機制分析，控制策略就缺少另一半。~Increasing pressure solely to prevent collapse ignores uplift and surface escape paths, which may open along weak layers. Without an upper-bound mechanism the control concept remains fundamentally incomplete.
不排水穩定比值~Undrained stability index||黏土短期開挖常以不排水強度描述，荷載差除以強度可形成規一化穩定指標。臨界值依幾何、覆土及破壞機制而變，不能從別案搬一個常數就直接設定支護。~Short-term clay excavation often uses undrained strength. Dividing a load difference by that strength produces a normalized stability index, but its critical value depends on geometry, cover and failure mechanism rather than one transferable constant.||假設荷載差150 kPa、su=50 kPa，示意N=150/50=3；此值未提供任何通用合格門檻。~For assumed load difference 150 kPa and su=50 kPa, illustrative N=3; no universal acceptance threshold is implied.||由代表性取樣與應變速率資料建立su範圍，檢查軟層是否控制整個面；使用適合斷面與覆土的分析並比較敏感度，只有專業設計審查可決定實際控制界線。~Establish a representative su range with strain-rate context and identify controlling weak layers; use analysis matching geometry and cover and compare sensitivity, leaving actual control boundaries to professional design review.||平均強度會掩蓋薄弱層，將重塑強度或完整強度任意替換又改變意義；穩定指標小數位精細也無法補足材料代表性不足。~Average strength can hide a weak interbed, and substituting remolded for intact strength changes the meaning. Fine decimal precision in a stability index cannot compensate for unrepresentative material data.
砂土滲流與濾膜~Sand seepage and filter cake||砂土中支護壓力需透過介質與土體界面傳遞，滲透太深時壓力作用範圍和有效應力路徑會改變。泥膜不是抽象的完美邊界，粒徑、滲透性和介質特性共同控制壓力傳遞。~In sand, support pressure transfers through the medium-ground interface. Deep infiltration changes the loaded region and effective-stress path. A filter cake is not a perfect abstract boundary; grading, permeability and medium behavior govern transfer.||假設孔隙比e=0.7、Gs=2.65，理想向上滲流臨界梯度ic=(Gs−1)/(1+e)=0.971；非掌子面設計門檻。~Assume void ratio e=0.7 and Gs=2.65; ideal upward-seepage critical gradient ic=(Gs−1)/(1+e)=0.971, not a face-design threshold.||以代表性砂樣做合格試驗比較滲透與濾膜形成，記錄壓差、滲流及顆粒流失；工程師需確認試驗方向、尺度與現場相符，不把一維向上滲流公式直接套到三維掌子面。~Test representative sand for infiltration and filter formation with pressure, flow and particle-loss records; engineers verify direction and scale, avoiding direct transfer of a one-dimensional upward-flow relation to a three-dimensional face.||若假設完整泥膜卻實際深度滲入，名義倉壓不等於有效支護，出現細砂流失仍可能被忽略；濾膜破裂也會使原本穩定的壓力傳遞突然改變。~Assuming an intact cake during deep infiltration equates chamber pressure with effective support incorrectly. Fine-sand loss may be missed, and cake rupture can abruptly change a previously stable transfer mechanism.
體積平衡與失土~Volume balance and ground loss||開挖體積、出土量與倉內儲量構成收支，但出土含水與改良材料會使重量和體積不直接可比。短暫收支差可能是儲量變化，持續差異才需結合沉陷與壓力評估失土。~Excavated volume, discharge and chamber storage form a balance, but water and conditioning change mass-volume conversion. Temporary imbalance can reflect storage; persistent discrepancies require pressure and settlement evidence before interpreting ground loss.||假設直徑6 m、前進1.5 m，理論體積πD²L/4=42.41 m³；出土差額須先校正添加量與鬆脹。~Assume diameter 6 m and advance 1.5 m; theoretical volume πD²L/4=42.41 m³, with discharge differences corrected for additions and bulking first.||同步行程、重量、含水率與添加材料紀錄，將出土量換成同一乾土或原位體積基準；比較倉壓和地表監測，未閉合收支由設備與地工人員共同查因，不能只用單環百分比判定。~Synchronize advance, mass, moisture and additions and convert discharge to a common dry-soil or in-situ basis; compare pressure and settlement and jointly investigate imbalance rather than judging one ring percentage alone.||把濕土重量增加當成超挖會誤調控制，反之漏計螺旋機持續出土可能掩蓋倉內減量；資料時間不同步則會製造假的短時失土。~Mistaking increased wet mass for overexcavation prompts wrong adjustments, while uncounted continued discharge hides chamber depletion. Unsynchronized records can manufacture an apparent short-term ground-loss event.
停機與壓力演變~Standstill and pressure evolution||停機後土倉和地層仍會排水、固結或滲漏，壓力不一定維持推進時的分布。土壤改良物性也隨時間改變，因此停機情境需獨立分析，不能把推進穩態直接延長。~After stopping, drainage, consolidation and leakage continue and alter pressure distribution. Conditioning properties also age, so standstill requires a separate scenario rather than indefinite extension of the advancing steady state.||假設教學一階衰減p(t)=p0e^(−t/τ)，p0=200 kPa、τ=10 h，2 h後163.7 kPa；非現場預測。~For an assumed teaching decay p(t)=p0e^(−t/τ), p0=200 kPa and τ=10 h give 163.7 kPa after 2 h; this is not a field prediction.||比較停機前後多高度壓力、出入量和地下水條件，記錄每次停機原因及持續時間；任何需重新建立支護的處置依核准程序與專業人員執行，算例衰減常數不能當現場等待時間。~Compare multiheight pressures, inflow-outflow and groundwater before and during stops, recording cause and duration; restoring support follows approved specialist procedures, and the illustrative time constant is not a permissible waiting period.||只監看平均倉壓會漏掉分層或局部氣穴，長停機後介質失去可塑性也可能造成壓力傳遞不均；重新推進時風險不再等同停止前。~Average pressure can hide stratification or local voids, while aged material loses plasticity and transfers load unevenly. Restart conditions therefore need not resemble the state immediately before stopping.
混合地層與面內差異~Mixed ground across the face||掌子面同時遇到砂、黏土或硬軟界面時，各區滲透、強度與切削阻力不同。單一平均參數會抹去最不利局部機制，且刀盤擾動可能使原本隔離的水路連通。~A face crossing sand, clay or a hard-soft interface contains contrasting permeability, strength and cutting resistance. Average parameters conceal adverse local mechanisms, and cutter disturbance can connect previously separated water pathways.||假設面積30 m²中6 m²為高透水砂，比例20%；面積小不代表其對滲流風險只貢獻20%。~If an assumed 30 m² face contains 6 m² permeable sand, its area fraction is 20%; its seepage-risk contribution is not necessarily only 20%.||利用超前孔與地質剖面估計界面位置範圍，將面內不同區域分開分析並比對扭矩、壓力及出土變化；只在證據支持下更新混合面模型，不以平均土樣取代局部砂層。~Use probing and sections to bound interface position and analyze face regions separately against torque, pressure and discharge; update mixed-face models only with evidence and do not replace a local sand layer with an average sample.||薄砂層可能主導水土流失而被平均黏土參數掩蓋，硬塊又會造成局部擾動；若只因整體倉壓正常便忽略異常出土，可能錯過局部失穩。~A thin sand layer can dominate erosion despite clay-dominated averages, while hard inclusions disturb the face locally. Normal mean chamber pressure does not justify ignoring anomalous discharge indicating localized instability.
模型敏感度與可靠性~Model sensitivity and reliability||面穩定結果受土強度、水位與覆土等輸入共同影響，最敏感參數不一定是變異最大的參數。應將物理模型誤差與量測不確定分開，不用單一名義計算掩蓋不利組合。~Face-stability results depend on strength, water and cover jointly. The most sensitive parameter need not be the most variable. Separate model error from measurement uncertainty and examine adverse combinations rather than one nominal calculation.||假設示意指標N=150/su，su由50降40 kPa時N由3增至3.75，增加25%；不是失敗機率。~For assumed illustrative N=150/su, lowering su from 50 to 40 kPa increases N from 3 to 3.75, or 25%; this is not a failure probability.||針對地質資料支持的上下限做組合分析，記錄參數相關性與模型適用範圍；設計審查應說明哪一種新調查最能縮小決策不確定性，而非只列很多沒有物理依據的模擬案例。~Analyze combinations supported by geological bounds with documented correlations and model scope; review which additional investigation most reduces decision uncertainty rather than listing many simulations without physical justification.||獨立亂抽實際相關參數可能製造不可能的情境或漏掉共同不利狀態，把敏感度當機率又會給出虛假的可靠度，誤導支護與監測資源配置。~Independently sampling correlated parameters creates impossible combinations or misses jointly adverse states. Treating sensitivity as probability invents numerical reliability and misdirects support and monitoring resources.
證據整合與審查界線~Evidence integration and review boundaries||面穩定不能僅由倉壓正常判定，還需出土、沉陷、地質與設備狀態相互支持。控制文件應指出哪種偏離會使模型失效及誰負責審查，讓學徒理解數學結果與操作授權之間的界線。~Normal chamber pressure alone does not establish stability; discharge, settlement, geology and equipment condition must agree. Control documents identify deviations invalidating the model and responsible reviewers, separating mathematical interpretation from operational authorization.||假設5類證據中4類正常、1類持續異常，正常比例80%；不得以多數決取消異常的獨立調查。~If 4 of an assumed 5 evidence streams appear normal and 1 remains abnormal, 80% normality cannot overrule independent investigation of the anomaly.||以案例演練壓力正常但出土或沉陷異常的情境，核對通知、獨立確認與責任分工；實際機器參數、停機和復工均依核准工程計畫，課程模型只支援判讀而不發出操作指令。~Rehearse cases with normal pressure but abnormal discharge or movement, checking notification, independent confirmation and responsibility; machine settings, stopping and restart remain under an approved engineering plan rather than course-generated commands.||多數訊號正常可能只是共享同一失效感測器或延遲資料，若把異常當離群刪除，最早的局部失穩證據會消失；報告必須保留不一致與處置。~Several normal indicators may share a failed sensor or delayed data. Deleting the dissenting signal as an outlier can erase the earliest localized-instability evidence, so discrepancies and responses must remain recorded.
''')
